{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q7120082","formula":"C₁₅H₁₆ClN₅","hill":"C15H16ClN5","elements":["H","C","N","Cl"],"composition":{"C":15.0,"H":16.0,"N":5.0,"Cl":1.0},"names":{"en":"PP2"},"descriptions":{"en":"PP2 is a substance that has frequently been used in cancer research as a \"selective\" inhibitor for Src-family kinases. It strongly inhibits the kinases Lck (IC50=4 nM), Fyn (5 nM) and Hck (5 nM), shows weaker inhibition of epidermal growth factor receptor (480 nM) and practically no inhibition of ZAP-70 (100 μM) and JAK2 (50 μM). Despite its extensive use as a Src-selective inhibitor, recent research has shown that PP2 is non-selective and inhibits many other kinases with similar affinities."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":4878,"mass":301.77,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(C)(C)N1C2=NC=NC(=C2C(=N1)C3=CC=C(C=C3)Cl)N","inchikey":"PBBRWFOVCUAONR-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1-tert-butyl-3-(4-chlorophenyl)pyrazolo[3,4-d]pyrimidin-4-amine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"4878","atoms":37,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.123,"y":-0.656,"z":0.0,"el":"Cl"},{"x":1.782,"y":-0.819,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":0.557,"y":-1.323,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":2.998,"y":1.265,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":1.461,"y":3.159,"z":-0.001,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.911,"y":2.894,"z":0.001,"el":"N"},{"x":2.925,"y":-1.773,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":3.791,"y":-1.548,"z":1.26,"el":"C"},{"x":3.784,"y":-1.558,"z":-1.266,"el":"C"},{"x":2.502,"y":-3.263,"z":0.007,"el":"C"},{"x":1.886,"y":0.513,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.577,"y":0.963,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.193,"y":-0.215,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.63,"y":-0.323,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.381,"y":2.34,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.32,"y":-0.376,"z":-1.208,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.321,"y":-0.373,"z":1.208,"el":"C"},{"x":2.685,"y":2.579,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.712,"y":-0.479,"z":-1.208